{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/b58d35d497ff561d13396fce8c8a926e.poster.avif?t=1760902241\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/b58d35d497ff561d13396fce8c8a926e.webm?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/b58d35d497ff561d13396fce8c8a926e.mp4?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/fb0bea6300466d7c0c704d35739e92cb.poster.avif?t=1760902241\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/fb0bea6300466d7c0c704d35739e92cb.webm?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/fb0bea6300466d7c0c704d35739e92cb.mp4?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Each world changes the rules of battle. In one, armor won\u2019t save you \u2014 in another, every strike will hit back even harder. Some worlds will block or strip your cards away. The order of invasion matters \u2014 a world vulnerable to your strategy can wait, but another might punish you right from the start</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/7c02455dfff89b882724f147f656fef0.poster.avif?t=1760902241\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/7c02455dfff89b882724f147f656fef0.webm?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/7c02455dfff89b882724f147f656fef0.mp4?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/f559d059c562f393d3f9e601309be26f.poster.avif?t=1760902241\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/f559d059c562f393d3f9e601309be26f.webm?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/f559d059c562f393d3f9e601309be26f.mp4?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Spend your gold wisely \u2014 every coin counts. Invest for greater future rewards, but don\u2019t forget to arm your clones and forge your gear. Without balance, your conquest will end before it even begins.\u00a0Prices may change \u2014 instead of the lifesteal axe you hoped for, you might find black holes, anvils, or hats of wisdom on sale. But in skilled hands, there\u2019s always a way to turn it into a winning strategy</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/db90b18726209cadce816af193fc72cb.poster.avif?t=1760902241\" width=720 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/db90b18726209cadce816af193fc72cb.webm?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/db90b18726209cadce816af193fc72cb.mp4?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/87fa5b7d6f87f99f2f793f485e32ae4f.poster.avif?t=1760902241\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/87fa5b7d6f87f99f2f793f485e32ae4f.webm?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918840/extras/87fa5b7d6f87f99f2f793f485e32ae4f.mp4?t=1760902241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Mix traits, weapons, and armor \u2014 everything changes how your clones behave and look</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Will you deploy a stealthy ninja in light armor with a sword?</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Or a reckless caster who summons a black hole that consumes everything \u2014 enemies, allies\u2026 and himself?</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Or perhaps a blacksmith who forges equipment for your clones right on the battlefield?</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Or a mage who casts a global barrier protecting every ally?</strong></i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Or don't equip your clones, and instead choose one who will absorb all the damage meant for your team, unleashing it in a single powerful superstrike</strong></i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>It\u2019s your choice \u2014 you are the rightful master of the worlds!</u></h2><h